        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se dispute constamment les arbres les plus confortables avec Quartermac et remporte la victoire la moitié du temps.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "In their search for comfortable trees, they get into territorial disputes with groups of Passimian. They win about half the time.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "居心地の良い　木を　巡って ナゲツケサルのグループと　縄張りを 争っている。　結果は　５分だ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "なにを　するにも　シッポを　つかう。 ２ほんの　シッポで　だきしめられたら ほんとうに　なつかれた　あかし。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il utilise toujours ses deux queues pour faire la moindre tâche. Il s’en sert aussi pour enlacer les gens qu’il affectionne tout particulièrement.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It uses its tails for everything. If it wraps both of its tails around you and gives you a squeeze, that’s proof it really likes you.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "なにを　するにも　シッポを　使う。 ２本の　シッポで　抱きしめられたら 本当に　懐かれた　証。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
